01:01:05,454 --> 01:01:11,454
Powder is a 1995 American science fiction drama film
written and directed by Victor Salva.

13
01:06:10,909 --> 01:06:16,909
It stars Mary Steenburgen, Sean Patrick Flanery,
Lance Henriksen, and Jeff Goldblum.

14
01:11:16,363 --> 01:11:22,363
Flanery plays the title character, a young albino man with an
incredible intellect and supernatural powers.

15
01:16:21,818 --> 01:16:27,818
The film was produced by Walt Disney Studios
through its Hollywood Pictures label.

16
01:21:27,272 --> 01:21:33,272
Filming took place in Texas around suburbs of
Houston, San Antonio, and Austin, Texas.

17
01:26:32,727 --> 01:26:38,727
The production was controversial due to Salva's prior conviction for child sex
abuse, which prompted a boycott against the film led by his victim.

18
01:31:38,181 --> 01:31:44,181
Powder was released October 27, 1995.

19
01:36:43,636 --> 01:36:49,636
It received mixed reviews, but was a commercial success,
grossing $30.9 million on a $9.5 million budget.

20
01:41:49,090 --> 01:41:55,090
The film explores themes of teenage boy, held at gunpoint,
teacher student relationship, albino, fainting.

21
01:46:54,545 --> 01:47:00,545
The tone is emotional.
